{'symbol': 'QCOM', 'date': '2022-03-09 09:00:00', 'title': 'QUALCOMM INCREASES QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND BY 10 PERCENT', 'text': "SAN DIEGO, MARCH 9, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0QUALCOMM INCORPORATED (NASDAQ: QCOM)\xa0TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS HAS APPROVED A 10 PERCENT INCREASE IN THE COMPANY'S QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND. THE QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND WILL INCREASE FROM $0.68 TO $0.75 PER SHARE OF COMMON STOCK AND WILL BE EFFECTIVE FOR QUARTERLY DIVIDENDS PAYABLE AFTER MARCH 24, 2022."}